**Design Decisions Summary:**

| Task Type | Rule Type | Rationale |
|-----------|-----------|-----------|
| find (×4) | position_near_with_facing | Player must navigate to landmark (max_distance=5) and face it (±60°). Reduced from 16 to 5 blocks per ValidatorAgent's critique to prevent triggering from spawn. |
| mine (×2) | inventory_has | Mined items drop into inventory. Simple, reliable check. |
| craft (×5) | inventory_has | Crafted items end up in inventory. Works for all craft tasks including the snowball workaround. |
| hook spider (×1) | count_in_box_at_most | Spider death via lava pit is the only way it disappears from the tightly-scoped arena box. NoAI + PersistenceRequired prevent false positives from wandering/despawning. |

**Key improvements from V1:**
1. All `find` milestones use `max_distance=5` (down from 16) — requires actual navigation
2. Spider milestone uses a tight arena-scoped box `[14,-20,13] to [20,5,19]` instead of the entire scene
3. Spider arena redesign makes the milestone achievable via the stated action (hook → pull off pillar → lava death)
4. All milestones have detailed descriptions explaining both WHAT is checked and WHY that rule type was chosen

